            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000027",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/moon-valley-siwa-oasis.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A tranquil courtyard with lush greenery, vibrant pink flowers, and a distinctive rock formation in the background, under a thatched roof"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Relaxing in the heart of Siwa Oasis, where nature's artistry meets human hospitality"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Fiestas Cultura En El Oasis De Siwa"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Enclavado en el corazón "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "del desierto occidental"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " de Egipto, el oasis de Siwa surge como un espejismo, ofreciendo una mezcla de paisajes impresionantes y rico patrimonio cultural."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este oasis, refugio de antiguas tradiciones, alberga algunos de los acontecimientos más singulares y espiritualmente significativos de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/el-desierto-occidental-en-egipto/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/el-desierto-occidental-en-egipto",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Festival Siyaha: Una Celebración de Armonía y Renovación"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "w95436p1ngmi",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En el corazón del calendario cultural de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "bvm6q64w40pm",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "4993csyfyf44"
              ],
              "text": "Siwa"
            },
            {
              "_key": "a6q7v9hi0e28",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " está el Festival de Siyaha, un acontecimiento vibrante y unificador."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cada año, bajo la radiante luna llena de octubre, la montaña Gebel Dakrur se transforma en un bullicioso centro de celebración."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Durante tres días, miles de siwanos se reúnen no sólo para disfrutar de la abundante cosecha de dátiles, sino también para renovar los lazos de amistad y resolver las disputas del año anterior."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "4993csyfyf44",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58932",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Unidad en la diversidad: La Fiesta Comunal"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El festival trasciende las divisiones sociales y económicas, ya que todos los siwaneses, independientemente de su estatus, se reúnen para un gran festín tras la oración del mediodía "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000017"
              ],
              "text": "de cada"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " día."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Este acto de comida comunitaria simboliza el arraigado sentido de unidad y hermandad entre la comunidad de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001c"
              ],
              "text": "Siwan"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viajes-de-baris/abrazar-el-clima-de-baris-una-guia-de-viaje-para-cada-estacion/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/baris/el-clima-en-baris-y-la-mejor-epoca-para-visitarla",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/hitos-historicos-de-siwa/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/hitos-historicos-de-siwa",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000021",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El Sufismo en el Núcleo: El Zikr Encantador "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Al anochecer, el recinto del festival palpita de energía espiritual."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cientos de hombres forman un círculo y se embarcan en un zikr, una fascinante sesión de danza, balanceo y canto."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Estos cantos repetitivos, cargados de alabanzas a Dios, reflejan la íntima conexión "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000027"
              ],
              "text": "del festival con"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " el sufismo."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/ritmos-del-nilo-el-cairo-cena-crucero-con-danza-del-vientre/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/cena-crucero-por-el-nilo-en-el-cairo-con-danza-oriental",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El papel de las mujeres y los visitantes"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000033",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Tradicionalmente, las mujeres "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002e"
              ],
              "text": "siwan"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " no participan en las festividades nocturnas, aunque se pueden ver muchachas de hasta unos 12 años hasta la puesta del sol."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El encanto y la profundidad espiritual de la fiesta atraen a cientos de no siwaneses, tanto egipcios como visitantes internacionales."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/oasis-de-siwa-una-aventura-epica-eterna/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/oasis-de-siwa-una-aventura-epica-eterna",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000035",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una nota sobre la historia reciente"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000003f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000036",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Es importante señalar que el festival se suspendió temporalmente en 2011 debido a problemas de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000038",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000037"
              ],
              "text": "seguridad"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000039",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " tras la revolución."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Los "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000003c"
              ],
              "text": "visitantes que"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " deseen experimentar este acontecimiento único deben confirmar su celebración con antelación."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000037",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/como-evitar-estafas-en-las-piramides-de-giza/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/como-evitar-estafas-en-las-piramides-de-giza",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000003c",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/vacaciones-inolvidables-en-egipto/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/vacaciones-inolvidables-en-egipto",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000041",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000040",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Moulid at-Tagmigra: La Reunión Sagrada"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000048",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000042",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Otro momento "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000044",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000043"
              ],
              "text": "destacado"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000045",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " del tapiz cultural de Siwa es el Moulid at-Tagmigra, una fiesta de santos que se celebra justo después de la cosecha de maíz, a finales del verano."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000046",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000047",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Centrada en torno a la pequeña tumba santuario de Sidi Suleiman, situada detrás de la Mezquita del Rey Fuad, esta celebración está marcada por pancartas, zikrs y un sentimiento de reverencia."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000043",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-suez/destacados/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-suez/destacados/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000004a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000049",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una Invitación Abierta a Presenciar las Tradiciones Sufíes "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000056",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000004b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El Moulid at-Tagmigra, conocido localmente como el Moulid at-Tagmigra, es un momento de fervor religioso."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Aquí, especialmente los jueves por la noche, los sufíes "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000004f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000004e"
              ],
              "text": "locales"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000050",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " de la orden Arusya se reúnen para hacer zikr, creando una atmósfera de devoción y misticismo."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000051",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000052",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Estas reuniones, impregnadas de profundidad espiritual, acogen al ocasional observador extranjero, ofreciendo una rara visión del corazón "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000054",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000053"
              ],
              "text": "de las prácticas sufíes en Siwa"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000055",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
